  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "sentence": "In June, the European Commission received a request from Brussels.",
      "paragraph_id": 0,
      "word_count": 10,
      "start_time": 0.0,
      "end_time": 4.975,
      "duration": 4.975,
      "phoneme_count": 65
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "sentence": "The costs for the renovation of the central area that houses the European Union\u2019s most important institutions, including the commission, were running over.",
      "paragraph_id": 0,
      "word_count": 23,
      "start_time": 4.975,
      "end_time": 15.825,
      "duration": 10.85,
      "phoneme_count": 156
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "sentence": "With debt levels already dangerously high, the city was in desperate need of funds.",
      "paragraph_id": 0,
      "word_count": 14,
      "start_time": 15.825,
      "end_time": 21.8,
      "duration": 5.975,
      "phoneme_count": 85
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "sentence": "To many readers, this might sound as if the European Union dispatched a request to itself.",
      "paragraph_id": 0,
      "word_count": 16,
      "start_time": 21.8,
      "end_time": 28.4,
      "duration": 6.6,
      "phoneme_count": 92
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "sentence": "Yet for inhabitants of the city \u2014 including me \u2014 the equation between the bloc and Brussels is anything but self-evident.",
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "word_count": 21,
      "start_time": 28.4,
      "end_time": 37.0,
      "duration": 8.6,
      "phoneme_count": 125
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "sentence": "Brussels, Belgium\u2019s bilingual capital, is not just home to E.U. institutions, which employ around 50,000 people, usually in the same expat bubble.",
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "word_count": 22,
      "start_time": 37.0,
      "end_time": 48.8,
      "duration": 11.8,
      "phoneme_count": 163
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "sentence": "With a population of over 1.2 million, it also possesses its own large city government and has been, since 1989, one of the country\u2019s three semiautonomous regions.",
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "word_count": 27,
      "start_time": 48.8,
      "end_time": 62.475,
      "duration": 13.675,
      "phoneme_count": 192
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "sentence": "For one of the most diverse cities in the world, around 45 percent of whose citizens are foreign born, this amounts to a decades-long experiment in self-rule.",
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "word_count": 27,
      "start_time": 62.475,
      "end_time": 73.825,
      "duration": 11.35,
      "phoneme_count": 170
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "sentence": "That effort is now under serious strain.",
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "word_count": 7,
      "start_time": 73.825,
      "end_time": 76.9,
      "duration": 3.075,
      "phoneme_count": 41
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "sentence": "For over a year, Brussels has been without a working government.",
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "word_count": 11,
      "start_time": 76.9,
      "end_time": 81.525,
      "duration": 4.625,
      "phoneme_count": 65
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "sentence": "Signs of dysfunction \u2014 from rising homelessness to crumbling infrastructure \u2014 are accumulating, and a fiscal crisis not unlike New York City\u2019s in the 1970s is on the horizon.",
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "word_count": 29,
      "start_time": 81.525,
      "end_time": 94.45,
      "duration": 12.925,
      "phoneme_count": 193
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "sentence": "Escalating drug violence has even led some to liken the city to crime-ridden Marseilles in France.",
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "word_count": 16,
      "start_time": 94.45,
      "end_time": 101.475,
      "duration": 7.025,
      "phoneme_count": 98
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "sentence": "Brussels, it seems, is nearing the end of its experiment in urban autonomy.",
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "word_count": 13,
      "start_time": 101.475,
      "end_time": 107.25,
      "duration": 5.775,
      "phoneme_count": 77
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "sentence": "The significance of this eclipse goes beyond Belgium.",
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "word_count": 8,
      "start_time": 107.25,
      "end_time": 111.475,
      "duration": 4.225,
      "phoneme_count": 52
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "sentence": "As Western countries lurch further rightward, many liberals and progressives have cast their eyes on cities as potential fortresses against reaction.",
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "word_count": 21,
      "start_time": 111.475,
      "end_time": 122.025,
      "duration": 10.55,
      "phoneme_count": 148
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "sentence": "In Hungary the mayor of Budapest is a leading figure in the opposition to Viktor Orban\u2019s regime, just as Warsaw\u2019s mayor was the liberal standard-bearer in the recent presidential election in Poland.",
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "word_count": 32,
      "start_time": 122.025,
      "end_time": 136.025,
      "duration": 14.0,
      "phoneme_count": 203
    },
